"privacy.title" = "Privacy Policy";
"privacy.body" = "RightClick Text works locally. It has no accounts, ads, analytics, tracking, or network requests, and collects no usage data.\n\nThe app stores folder permission bookmarks in its private sandbox. Folder paths and short-lived creation requests are shared only with its Finder and Quick Action extensions in a local App Group. These are never uploaded.\n\nThe Finder Services entry uses a separate, temporary sandboxed process to create the file with access supplied by Finder for that invocation. This process has no saved permission bookmarks and does not use the main app’s bookmarks. Creation is still limited to the folders selected in Setup and their subfolders.\n\nYou can remove folder access at any time in Setup. This does not delete files you created. Close Setup to quit the main app; a Finder action briefly starts it again. Your cloud provider may sync files created in its folders.\n\nNo Accessibility, Automation, Full Disk Access, or login item is required. Contacting support opens your email app; only information you choose to send is shared.\n\nSupport: sapplex@icloud.com\nEffective: October 4, 2026 · Version 1.0";
