"tutorial.accessibility.cloudService" = "Illustrated tutorial: allow the cloud folder in Setup, then right-click that folder from its parent and choose Services, then New Text File. The app creates inside it without opening the folder or selecting the text file. The demo then shows the user opening the folder, clicking the new file, pressing Return, changing its name while keeping .txt, and pressing Return to confirm. The cloud-folder empty-space menu is unreliable and is not the recommended entry point. This demo creates no real files.";

